Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 17:51:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix saving session discovery via backend GraphQL

Use backend GraphQL savingSessions data instead of decoding /accounts payload, add strict response-shape validation, and drive monitoring/UI from available events so upcoming sessions are detected before join.

